==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|perk|y}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɜː(ɹ)ki}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|perk|ier}}

# [[lively|Lively]] or [[enthusiastic]].
#: ''She answered with a '''perky''' smile and bounced off.''
# Standing [[upright]]; [[firm]].
#: ''The plant looks much '''perkier''' since I watered it.''
#: '''''perky''' breasts''

